flowchart TB
    Update[shipmates update] --> Manifest[Read manifest v2 baselines]
    Manifest --> Each[Inspect each managed Codex artifact]
    Each --> Changed{user edited?}
    Changed -->|no| Refresh[Refresh changed catalog content]
    Changed -->|yes| Conflict[Keep, take, or write sidecar]
    Refresh --> Commit[Atomically update manifest]
    Conflict --> Commit
    Each -. never overwrite .-> Memory[Persistent persona memory]
    Legacy[Manifest v1] --> Refuse[Refuse normal update]
    Refuse --> Plan[Explicit migrate codex --plan]
    Plan --> Apply[Optional explicit --apply]
    Apply --> Preserve[Preserve modified and untracked legacy data]
